      "snippet": "# 2026-04-27 - OpenClaw boot debugging: for `/new` and `/reset`, patching only `dist/bundled/boot-md/handler.js` is not enough. The bundled hook metadata file `dist/bundled/boot-md/HOOK.md` also must declare `\"events\": [\"gateway:startup\", \"command:new\", \"command:reset\"]`, because the loader registers internal hook listeners from HOOK.md metadata. - Runtime findings from boot investigation: workspace bootstrap injection included `AGENTS.md`, `SOUL.md`, `TOOLS.md`, `IDENTITY.md`, `USER.md`, `HEARTBEAT.md`, `BOOTSTRAP.md` but not `BOOT.md`; original bundled `boot-md` only ran on `gateway:startup` until patched. - Active OpenClaw config change applied in `~/.openclaw/openclaw.json`: `agents.def",
